OL,3,GNEWSAHospitals, GPs and police hit by
OL,4,AMicrosoft outage
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice forces, hospitals, GP surgeries
OL,7,Fand councils across the south of
OL,8,FEngland have been sharing advice and
OL,9,Fupdates after a global Microsoft outage
OL,10,Fleft them without email access.
OL,12,FMost said they continued to operate as
OL,13,Fnormal but some online forms and
OL,14,Felectronic-based services were not
OL,15,Fworking and there were delays answering
OL,16,Fenquiries.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,334,330,200,160,0,100
