OL,3,GNEWSAHospitals, GPs and police hit by
OL,4,AMicrosoft outage
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe region's three police forces -
OL,7,FHampshire & Isle of Wight, Thames
OL,8,FValley and Dorset - all said their
OL,9,Fphone lines were working and they were
OL,10,Fable to respond to emergencies but
OL,11,Ftheir online reporting systems were
OL,12,Fdown.
OL,14,FHospitals asked outpatients to attend
OL,15,Fbooked appointments, adding there was
OL,16,Fno need to check they were going ahead.
